:: Millers Babysitting Twin Bedroom Closet [nobr]

/* Intro */
You walk into the twin’s decent-sized walk-in closet, <span style="Color: Yellow">feeling a touch of jealousy that even the youngest members of the Miller family get such an impressive closet.</SPAN> It has polished wooden floors and soft lighting that shines down from the ceiling, giving everything a gentle glow. Shelves and drawers line the walls, each organized to hold the twins’ impressive collection of clothes and shoes. You wonder if the boys organize this themselves, or if their father or some hired helps keep it so tidy. <span style="Color: LightGreen">It is definitely cleaner than their bedroom.</span> <br>

