<span style="Color: Pink">During your snooping, you find the twin’s shared underwear drawer, a divider in the middle separating their colorful, childish briefs. It is kind of cute how the boys work so hard to keep things ‘theirs’ and you wonder if they chose their blue and red color-scheme or if it was something put on them since they were babies. Though the thoughts only last a moment, since you can’t help but find their underwear rather inviting.</span> <br>
<br>
